OLD RRULE 2 of RRST /$3$NIsometric_ADP/RuleSet
STYF STYLE /$3$NIsometric_ADP/Iso_Style_Rnode
CRIT  ALL RNODE

OLD RRULE 3 of RRST /$3$NIsometric_ADP/RuleSet
STYF STYLE /$3$NIsometric_ADP/Iso_Style_Ctmtrl
CRIT  ALL CTMTRL

OLD RRULE 4 of RRST /$3$NIsometric_ADP/RuleSet
STYF STYLE /$3$NIsometric_ADP/Iso_Style_Cway
CRIT  ALL CWAY

OLD RRULE 5 of RRST /$3$NIsometric_ADP/RuleSet
STYF STYLE /$3$NIsometric_ADP/Hidden_Style
CRIT  ALL BRCO

OLD RRULE 6 of RRST /$3$NIsometric_ADP/RuleSet
